GlassTranslate onefile bundle marker.

PyInstaller extracts the onefile bundle into %TEMP%\_MEIxxxxxx on every launch and removes it only
on a normal exit. run.py (frozen branch) sweeps every %TEMP%\_MEI* directory that contains this
file and is not the running process's own sys._MEIPASS, so a Task-Manager kill or a crash does not
leave ~360 MB behind. Never delete or rename this file: the spec bundles it at the bundle root.
